  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2024/05/IMG_20240514_195835.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(24 fotos) Este mi&eacute;rcoles abre sus puertas al p&uacute;blico en l&#39;Alcora, en la calle del Doctor Federico Michavila Pa&uacute;s, 4, El Sentidet. Estar&aacute; abierto todos los d&iacute;as, excepto martes, de 18 a 23 horas y podr&aacute;s cenar con las mejores pizzas, hamburguesas, tapas y bocadillos, de la mano de Alba Fern&aacute;ndez Molina, con m&aacute;s de cinco a&ntilde;os de experiencia ya en la Font de Dins de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/elsentidetlalcora/IMG_20240514_180845.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240514_180845\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/elsentidetlalcora/IMG_20240514_181315.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240514_181315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/elsentidetlalcora/IMG_20240514_181400.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240514_181400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/elsentidetlalcora/IMG_20240514_181809.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240514_181809\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/elsentidetlalcora/IMG_20240514_181819.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240514_181819\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/elsentidetlalcora/IMG_20240514_182340.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240514_182340\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/elsentidetlalcora/IMG_20240514_182342.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240514_182342\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/elsent